    </div>
    <div class="events-photo-trio reveal d3">
      <div class="events-photo-cell">
        <img src="/images/dinner-cam-speaking.jpg" alt="Founder speaking at the PVC dinner" />
      </div>
      <div class="events-photo-cell">
        <img src="/images/dinner-cam-connect.jpg" alt="Two founders connecting at dinner" />
      </div>
      <div class="events-photo-cell">
        <img src="/images/dinner-cam-laugh.jpg" alt="Founders laughing at the PVC dinner" />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="events-quote reveal d4">
      <p>"I've been to networking events before. All of them were terrible. This is different."</p>
      <cite>Sachin Moodley, Revolution Rise Media · PVC Founding Dinner, August 2026</cite>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ 06 · THE FOUNDER ═══ -->
<section id="founder" data-screen-label="06 Founder">
  <div class="founder-inner">
    <div class="founder-portrait reveal">
      <img src="/images/founder-portrait.jpg" alt="Lliam Humphrey, founder of Private Victories Club" />
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="founder-label reveal d1">The Founder</div>
      <div class="founder-story">
        <p class="reveal d1">I'm 20. I built this because I needed it to exist.</p>
        <p class="reveal d2">In the last six months, I've helped businesses generate and collect close to $200,000 in revenue through remote sales. I've built content that's reached millions of people. And I've done almost all of it without a room like this one.</p>
        <p class="reveal d3">The part that stayed with me wasn't the wins. It was how much harder they were than they needed to be. Information was never the problem. The right people were.</p>
        <p class="reveal d4">The right conversation can change your perspective. The right introduction can open a door. Being around people who take their ambitions seriously can raise your standards.</p>
        <p class="reveal d4">Not a room built around appearances or transactional networking — one built on trust, contribution, and people genuinely wanting to see each other win. That's why I built <em>PVC</em>.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="founder-sign reveal d4">
        <span class="founder-sign-tagline">Build in private. Win in public.</span>
        <span class="founder-sign-name">Lliam Humphrey</span>
        <span class="founder-sign-role">Founder, Private Victories Club</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ FAQ ═══ -->
<section id="faq" data-screen-label="FAQ">
  <div class="faq-inner">
    <div class="faq-header">
      <h2 class="faq-label reveal d1">Common<br /><em>Questions.</em></h2>
      <p class="faq-intro reveal d1">Everything you need to know about membership, how it works, and who it's for.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <div class="faq-item reveal d1">
        <button type="button" class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>WHAT HAPPENS AFTER I JOIN?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>It starts with a real conversation. We get on a call, understand where you're at, what you're building, what your goals are, and what's actually in your way. From there we plug you into the network and make your first introduction to a member or operator in the community who can directly help with what you're working on right now. You're in the community, the sessions, and the calls before your first week is out. You get real value before you've had time to wonder if this was worth it.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal d2">
        <button type="button" class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>HOW WILL IT HELP GROW MY BUSINESS?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>PVC isn't a course and it's not a coaching programme. It's a network of people who are actually building, alongside operators who've already built. Your standard rises when the people around you are moving. You start thinking differently when someone two steps ahead of you is accessible. Members also get a dedicated monthly session with a licensed financial advisor — someone who understands the realities of running a business. And the opportunities, the clients, the partnerships, the connections, they don't come from chasing. They come from consistently being in the right room. That's what PVC puts you in.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal d3">
        <button type="button" class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>WHO IS THIS FOR?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Founders already building and generating revenue — R20k a month minimum from a business you run. You've started, you're moving, you have a real problem you're solving and skin in the game. Not someone looking for motivation to begin. Someone who is already in it and wants to be around others who are moving too.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal d4">
        <button type="button" class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>DO I NEED TO BE IN SOUTH AFRICA?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Our events are curated and happen across South Africa and beyond. You don't need to be in any specific city to apply. Every application is reviewed, and the standard is the same wherever you are based.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal d4">
        <button type="button" class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>IS PVC A COURSE OR COACHING PROGRAMME?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>PVC is a private members club built around the network. It isn't a course teaching you how to start a business. The value comes from the people in the room, the conversations, the introductions and the experiences you share.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal d4">
        <button type="button" class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>HOW MUCH DOES MEMBERSHIP COST?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Membership fees are shared during the application process, before you make a commitment.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal d4">
        <button type="button" class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>DO I HAVE TO ATTEND IN-PERSON EVENTS?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>No. Members are encouraged to participate in the community, contribute to conversations and build relationships with other members. In-person events are curated and optional — they're there when you want them.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

